OL,3,GNEWSADaughter killed in crash 'taught
OL,4,Ame what love is'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a teenage girl who died
OL,7,Fin a crash has said her daughter taught
OL,8,Fher "what love is" as she waits for the
OL,9,Fdriver to be sentenced.
OL,11,FAlisha Marie Ponter, 16, from
OL,12,FFolkestone, died in a crash on the A249
OL,13,Fnear Sittingbourne in February 2024.
OL,14,FShe was a passenger in a car that hit a
OL,15,Froad barrier and overturned.
OL,17,FLinchem Connors, 19, from Horley,
OL,18,FSurrey, admitted causing death by
OL,19,Fdangerous driving at Maidstone Crown
OL,20,FCourt on 17 July and is due to be
OL,21,Fsentenced on 15 September.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
