OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADaughter killed in crash 'taught
OL,4,Ame what love is'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlisha's mother, Cody Marie Hobman,
OL,7,Fsaid her daughter knew the other
OL,8,Fpassenger in the vehicle but did not
OL,9,Fknow Connors, and has urged other girls
OL,10,F"not to be so trusting".
